OL,3,GNEWSAFive Lancashire groups among
OL,4,AKing's Award winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive organisations from across
OL,7,FLancashire have been recognised with
OL,8,Fthe highest award given to local
OL,9,Fvoluntary groups in the UK.
OL,11,FThe volunteers, who range from
OL,12,Fsupporting women to revitialising a
OL,13,Fcommunity centre, are among the 250
OL,14,Fnational charities and volunteer groups
OL,15,Fto get the King's Award for Voluntary
OL,16,FService this year.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
