OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFive Lancashire groups among
OL,4,AKing's Award winners
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach of the groups will receive a
OL,7,Fcertificate signed by the King and a
OL,8,Fcommemorative crystal, presented by the
OL,9,FLord-Lieutenant of Lancashire, Amanda
OL,10,FParker, at an awards ceremony at County
OL,11,FHall, in Preston.
OL,13,FParker said she was "delighted" with
OL,14,Fthe groups, adding: "Each is making an
OL,15,Fimportant contribution to its
OL,16,Fcommunity."
